// endpoint_watch_login_terminal.proto — WatchLoginTerminal: the login
// pty's duplex stream. WEB LINK section. Bidirectional: the client sends
// keystrokes and resize; the daemon streams raw pty bytes. Attach replays
// the session's scrollback first, so a late viewer sees the whole TUI.
// The stream CONCLUDES with `closed` when the login child exits — the
// client re-probes the account state then (the topbar chip updates on its
// own push).

